t":"GET /items/{id} is handled by read_item, whose declared parameters include current_user: CurrentUser.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":48,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-identity-current-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The supplied source defines CurrentUser through the get_current_user dependency, which decodes the token, loads the user, rejects missing users, rejects inactive users, and returns the user; the task premise, rather than this crop, establishes that the handler-entry value is the stated active superuser.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ec26811e863df154","startLine":30,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-resource-item","kind":"binding","statement":"read_item retrieves the requested Item by id and raises a not-found error if no item exists; the supplied task premise establishes that the retrieved item exists and is owned by another user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":53,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"f-superuser-control","kind":"control","statement":"The authorization guard rejects only a caller who is not a superuser and whose id differs from the item's owner; a superuser therefore bypasses the owner-mismatch denial.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"f-read-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"If the item is not rejected by the guard, read_item returns the item.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":56,"endLine":58}]},{"id":"f-owner-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The owner-mismatch condition is explicitly subordinate to the non-superuser condition, so the stated active superuser assumption makes the denial branch unreachable even though the owner differs.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-3df5de8f43bc9c54","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3795,"output":1024,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":49789.767100000005,"stopReason":"tool_use"}